quote.p:
—the annual exchange of professors to conduct special courses in history,
                        culture and economics at the relevant departments of Soviet and American
                        institutions of higher education;

—mutual allocation of scholarships for the best students in the natural
                        sciences, technology, social sciences, and humanities for the period of an
                        academic year;

list.item:
—nomination of distinguished American and Soviet educators or public
                        figures to study ways of improving understanding through language
                        studies;
